on":true,"id":416,"name":"TAP"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Ten years after the Bubble War, the dichotomy between the rich and the poor in the world becomes more prominent and Japan is no exception. The rich seeks to satisfy their desires and derive pleasure for themselves, and Tokyo has materialise into such a city as a result. Saiga, once a war photographer, works for Hibara Ginza in the capitalist state of Tokyo. He infiltrates into Roppongi Club, a secretive base located in the red district area of the city, to collect information about them. However, he was caught in the process and brought forward to a girl called Kagura who was in the midst of a ritual. His contact with Kagura awakens his special ability: the power to make things explode once photographed. In order to unravel the mystery behind the Roppongi Club and Kagura, Saiga begins his solitary battle.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Cult","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Photography","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fugitive","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Economics","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Drugs","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Terrorism","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Psychosexual","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Exhibitionism","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Masochism","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Pet Play","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Femdom","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Sadism","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":76,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Pr